Probe 检查未通过（Ready=False），应用对外不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n- **已确认的根因**：**应用服务依赖的上游服务不可用**。\n  证据编号：Logging (事实 3) 明确报告 `dependency unavailable`；Tracing (事实 4, 5) 和 K8s State (事实 1) 确认了由此导致的 503 响应和 Readiness 失败。\n- **缺失的决定性事实**：虽然现象指向依赖不可用，但输入事实中未提供 `aiops-lab-workload` 的下游调用拓扑（如调用了哪个 Service/Endpoint），也未提供上游服务的状态日志或连接错误详情（如 `Connection Refused`、`Timeout` 或 `DNS resolution failure`）。因此，无法精确定位是哪个具体的上游服务或网络策略导致了不可用。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.8m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 71.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6: 71.0s (Evidence 64.8s, RCA 6.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 109.615, "metrics": {"run_id": "a0ee0cd762c64cc7", "mttr": {"value": "1.8m", "seconds": 109.61616158485413, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.95, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.75, "weighted_score": 0.15}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-